```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "While reconciling a different cloud bill this morning, I confirmed that cross-region cache reads would create about $1,200 per month in egress charges, while regional cache reads would stay within the existing build-platform budget. I haven't updated the rollout document yet, but this is important for the rollout configuration decision."}
```

